{"id":"ba8d0751-9239-431c-ab46-9e2c6277a6cb","type":"https://serlo.org/editor","variant":"serlo-org","domainOrigin":"serlo.org","version":2,"editorVersion":"0.22.0","dateModified":"2025-02-26T18:21:36.064Z","document":{"plugin":"exercise","state":{"content":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"h","level":3,"children":[{"text":"Lineare Abbildung zwischen Vektorräumen unterschiedlicher Dimension"}]},{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"f40d0117-e99b-434c-8e76-6cff8e77e88a"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Ein Beispiel einer linearen Abbildung zwischen zwei Vektorräumen mit unterschiedlicher Dimension ist die folgende Projektion des Raums "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{R}³","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"R"}]},{"text":" auf die Ebene "},{"type":"math","src":"\mathbb{R}²:","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"92ea9ea8-a363-4bb6-bc9d-a07e59c76d5d"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"f: \mathbb{R}³ \to \mathbb{R}² ; \quad \begin{pmatrix}x\\y\\z \end{pmatrix} \mapsto \begin{pmatrix}x\\y \end{pmatrix}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"d30d35eb-3e14-4f80-9a93-8c3db59e8cd6"}],"id":"f41244b0-3f05-4016-8722-16be408a6da1"},"solution":{"plugin":"solution","state":{"strategy":{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"eaef0730-a9ea-438e-a59c-4d1ba209b591"},"steps":{"plugin":"rows","state":[{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Wir prüfen nun, ob die Vektoraddition erhalten bleibt. Also ob für Vektoren "},{"type":"math","src":"a,b\in\R^3","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"a,b\in\R^3"}]},{"text":" gilt"}]}],"id":"523bd70a-0c70-4384-9c4d-3288209af20f"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"{{f(a+b)=f(a)+f(b)}}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"{{Formel|<math>f(a+b)=f(a)+f(b)</math>}}"}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"27e4cbdb-9893-4400-b862-b045148f4733"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Dies können wir direkt nachweisen:"}]}],"id":"629db46c-b286-4a18-84df-b30b5930de8d"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{ll}
f(a+b)&= f\left( \begin{pmatrix}a_x\\a_y\\a_z \end{pmatrix} + \begin{pmatrix}b_x\\b_y\\b_z \end{pmatrix}\right)= f\left( \begin{pmatrix}a_x +b_x\\a_y+b_y\\a_z+b_z \end{pmatrix}\right) \\[2em]
& = \begin{pmatrix}a_x + b_x\\a_y +b_y \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix}a_x\\a_y \end{pmatrix} + \begin{pmatrix}b_x\\b_y \end{pmatrix} \\[1.5em]
& = f\left( \begin{pmatrix}a_x\\a_y\\a_z \end{pmatrix}\right) + f\left( \begin{pmatrix}b_x\\b_y\\b_z \end{pmatrix}\right)=f(a)+f(b).
\end{array}","inline":true,"children":[{"text":""}]},{"text":""}]}],"id":"7947d178-4c04-4e45-bd95-c11e80ce9622"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Nun überprüfen wir die Homogenität. Für alle "},{"type":"math","src":"\lambda \in \R","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"<math>\lambda \in \R</math>"}]},{"text":" und "},{"type":"math","src":"a\in\R^2","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"<math>a\in\R^2</math>"}]},{"text":" soll gelten: "}]},{"type":"math","src":"f(\lambda \cdot a)=\lambda \cdot f(a).","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"b1d6ffdb-a4ac-4410-b7d0-34247bf46b07"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Es ist"}]}],"id":"dd327e7c-54fc-4a82-9306-4d1aa6b1409b"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":""}]},{"type":"math","src":"\begin{array}{ll}
f(\lambda \cdot a)&= f\left(\lambda \cdot \begin{pmatrix}a_x\\a_y\\a_z \end{pmatrix}\right)  = f\left(\begin{pmatrix}\lambda a_x\\\lambda a_y\\\lambda a_z \end{pmatrix}\right ) \\[2em]
&= \begin{pmatrix}\lambda a_x\\ \lambda a_y \end{pmatrix} = \lambda \cdot \begin{pmatrix} a_x\\ a_y \end{pmatrix} = \lambda \cdot f\left(\begin{pmatrix}a_x\\a_y\\a_z \end{pmatrix}\right )\\[2em]
&=\lambda\cdot f(a).
\end{array}","inline":false,"children":[{"text":""}]}],"id":"ada73fbd-694d-4373-a8d2-2c7115643b55"},{"plugin":"text","state":[{"type":"p","children":[{"text":"Damit ist die Projektion "},{"type":"math","src":" f","inline":true,"children":[{"text":"f"}]},{"text":"  eine lineare Abbildung."}]}],"id":"a4877769-0c8b-423d-bcd0-9f53124d5d64"}],"id":"2820b899-2d3b-4acc-872f-14c93c1bc94e"}},"id":"cf3d8dda-e0c6-49f8-981b-4bd38b6d89bb"}},"id":"9b2ea0da-1499-4dc3-890d-be9b9eeab110"}}
